Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.34,0:00:50.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两大种族出现已过了二十年{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two decades had passed since the creation of both species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.21,0:00:52.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,战争早已展开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The war had begun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.38,0:00:56.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多壮大他的军队 创造吸血鬼军团{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor increased his army, creating a legion of vampires{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.79,0:00:59.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,来保护他们 免受第一氏狼族的攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to protect them from the very first clan of werewolves:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.12,0:01:05.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这个邪恶又有传染性的物种 永远无法转换成人形{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A vicious and infectious breed unable to take human form ever again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.63,0:01:08.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直到他出世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Until he was born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.10,0:01:16.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.14,0:01:25.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,虽然维克多身上的每个细胞 都警告他要处决这个孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And although every fiber of Viktor's soul warned him to slay this child,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.65,0:01:28.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但他没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.39,0:01:37.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,过了许多年 这孩子长大了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over the years, this child grew.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.76,0:01:42.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他拥有先前那个物种所没有的 力量和专注力{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He possessed a strength and focus that the ones before him did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.56,0:02:10.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得呢 索妮亚？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What do you think, Sonja?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.79,0:02:12.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该多制造一些吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shall we make more?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.63,0:02:14.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,制造他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.76,0:02:15.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,像他一样的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.66,0:02:19.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩永远都会是狼人族的始祖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian will always be the first of the breed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.73,0:02:21.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,第一个狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the first of the Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.58,0:02:33.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多利用卢西恩具有传染性的血{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor would use Lucian's infectious blood to his benefit,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.22,0:02:36.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,利用这孩子的饥渴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}taking advantage of the child's thirst,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.38,0:02:39.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,逼迫他以人类为食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}pitting it against him as he was forced to feed on humans,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.59,0:02:41.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也就是维克多的奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor's slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.69,0:02:46.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 进去! - 进里面去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get in there. - In there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.42,0:03:13.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他创造了一个新的不死种族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Instead, he created a new race of immortals:{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.45,0:03:14.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.66,0:03:17.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是狼也是人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Werewolf, but also human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.79,0:03:22.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不同的是 这个新种族可以被利用{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unlike the others, this new breed could be harnessed,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.73,0:03:26.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,作为在白昼守护他们主人的奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}enslaved to guard them in the daylight hours of their masters.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.54,0:03:29.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或者维克多是这么盘算的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or so Viktor thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.54,0:03:31.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是在很久以前{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so very long ago.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.24,0:03:43.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,《黑夜传说3：狼族再起》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.33,0:03:43.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:56.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,贵族们很失望 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The nobles are upset, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.76,0:03:59.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,威廉的传染病并未停止{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William's pestilence has not been checked.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.53,0:04:02.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 狼人们杀了他们的奴隶 - 人类很沮丧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Werewolves have killed their slaves. - Humans upset.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.27,0:04:06.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坦尼斯 记下我对这点感到很难过{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tannis, please take a note of what pain that brings me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.77,0:04:09.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们没了奴隶代表我们没了银子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet their lost slaves means our lost silver.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.78,0:04:12.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了!  我不是增加了十倍的收入？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough. Have I not increased our holdings tenfold{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.38,0:04:14.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自从马库斯和阿米莉亚冬眠后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}since Marcus and Amelia took their sleep?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.42,0:04:17.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们会照常对付狼族{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We will deal with the wolves as we always have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.83,0:05:41.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点! - 快啊! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come on! - Come on, quickly!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.38,0:05:56.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,射击! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.90,0:06:17.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关上大门{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Close that breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.55,0:06:34.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,铁匠 你除了玩武器之外{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you nothing better to do, blacksmith,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.89,0:06:36.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没别的事好做了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than play with weapons of war?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.82,0:06:38.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,做点有用的事吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At least make yourself useful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.96,0:06:42.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对救命恩人要心存感激 索妮亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A little gratitude, Sonja, to the one who saved your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.06,0:06:44.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我并不需要人救{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I needed no saving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.57,0:06:46.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,告诉我 卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tell me, Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.00,0:06:50.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀死自己的同类会令你感到难过吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Does it burden your heart to kill your own kind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:54.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不会 它们只是野兽 主人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not at all. They're mindless beasts, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.54,0:06:56.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不是我的伙伴 - 真的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No brethren of mine. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.95,0:06:59.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.59,0:07:11.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是你们族人的骄傲 你知道接下来该怎么做吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You are a credit to your race. Do you know how to remain so?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.09,0:07:14.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目光别离开地面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your eyes on the ground.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.50,0:07:16.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把那个处理掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get rid of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.47,0:07:23.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你真让理事会难堪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were sorely missed at council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.17,0:07:26.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还有其他事要忙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are other demands on my time, as you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.87,0:07:30.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 希望你享受月下散步{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I see. I hope you enjoyed your little moonlit ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.48,0:07:31.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是去巡逻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} I was out patrolling.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.75,0:07:35.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你根本是抗命 我说过要你待在城墙之内{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were disobeying. I told you to stay within these walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.45,0:07:37.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我这个做父亲的不能再任你挺而走险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You risk too much for a father to ignore.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.72,0:07:39.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把狼族交给死亡行者处理{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will leave the wolves to the Death Dealers.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.09,0:07:42.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？我冒的险又不比他们大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And why, Father, is my risk any greater than theirs?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.16,0:07:44.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是我女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are not my daughters,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.96,0:07:48.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也不是理事会成员 但你是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they are not council members. You are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.10,0:07:52.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,有一天 你会继承我成为长老{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And one day, you will become an elder, your birthright.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.77,0:07:58.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索妮亚 理事会很体谅你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonja, you are well thought of at council,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.11,0:08:00.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过那么做太危险了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but that is a precarious thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.91,0:08:03.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们开始厌烦你的游戏和缺席{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They grow tired of your games and your absences.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.75,0:08:09.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,森林里潜藏的危险并不比议会厅里多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The dangers of the forest are no greater than those of the council chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.85,0:08:14.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要学会舞弄政治 学会冷酷又狡猾{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will learn the dance of politics, to be ruthless and cunning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.62,0:08:18.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,更重要的是 你要对家族忠诚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And above all, you will be loyal to your family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.06,0:08:21.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对我忠诚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.66,0:08:26.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,毕竟 我们之间若没有忠诚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}After all, without the loyalty between us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.23,0:08:28.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就与门口那些野兽无异{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we are no better than the beasts at our door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.56,0:08:58.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,给我继续做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Put your back into it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.24,0:09:03.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,捡起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick that up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.11,0:09:10.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点 废物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it, you scum.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.68,0:09:17.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,多一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}More spin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.72,0:09:23.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,起来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.86,0:09:30.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lycan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.63,0:09:32.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不准休息 快工作! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No rest, dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.61,0:09:43.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.14,0:09:46.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你竟敢反抗我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You dare raise your hand to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.25,0:09:49.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我说够了 - 当主子的狗就能大声啦？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I said, that's enough. - So says the master's dog, hm?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.85,0:09:53.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会永远受他宠爱的 当你失宠时{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not always be his favorite, and when you fall,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.29,0:09:54.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我必会在场观看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.16,0:09:56.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等着瞧吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let us hope so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.29,0:10:01.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们看什么？ 马上回去工作! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What are you looking at? Get back to work now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.16,0:10:02.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回去工作! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get back to work!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.03,0:10:05.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回去工作! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Back to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.84,0:10:16.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,理事会眼前的议题很简单{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The matter before the council is simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:17.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们正遭受攻击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are under attack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.01,0:10:20.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这些日子以来有许多次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Six times in half as many weeks,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.28,0:10:22.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼族都攻到了我们墙边{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}William's kind have reached our very walls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.75,0:10:26.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若被攻破将会出现何等混乱？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What mayhem would follow ifjust one of them got through?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.19,0:10:28.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的恐惧 科洛曼 是无谓的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your fear, Coloman, is misplaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.12,0:10:31.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是有支不死大军护卫我们吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are we not protected by an army of immortals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.36,0:10:32.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}  Superbly, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.79,0:10:35.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而贵族们并不觉得…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}However, the nobles are not, and as I have pointed out,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.06,0:10:37.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过 他们是我们的财富来源{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}they are the grass on which we graze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.10,0:10:41.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们若无法保护人类 就表示我们的衰弱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If we cannot protect our humans, it makes us look weak.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.20,0:10:43.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你们要如何展现力量？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And how would you project strength?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.77,0:10:45.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,夜里由我们的死亡行者巡逻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As our Death Dealers patrol the night,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.14,0:10:48.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,白天则由我们的白昼门卫巡逻{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so our daylight guards can patrol the day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.21,0:10:50.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼人去城外巡逻？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lycans patrol outside the walls?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.21,0:10:52.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是疯了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you lost your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.21,0:10:54.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们是野兽的后代{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are born of beasts,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:57.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这可悲的事实不会消失的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and the savagery of this despicable fact cannot be bred away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.69,0:11:00.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你对这想法的惧怕是无谓的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think your fear of this idea is misplaced.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.92,0:11:03.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以创造一群特级的狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can create a privileged class of Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.99,0:11:09.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,提供更好的粮食、宿舍 让他们接受我们信赖的人来统领{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Greater rations, finer quarters, and put them under the hand of one we trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.30,0:11:11.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许就是你的宠物 卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps your pet, Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.33,0:11:13.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天救了你女儿一命的那个家伙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The one who saved your daughter's life today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.80,0:11:18.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,事实上 我想该听听她的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In fact, I think we should hear her thoughts on this matter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.01,0:11:24.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她似乎在忙别的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She seems to have been needed elsewhere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.35,0:11:26.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去找她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Find her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.25,0:11:33.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会将你的建议纳入考虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will take your suggestion under advisement.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.85,0:11:35.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢您 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Thank you, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.26,0:11:38.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在明天贵族们抵达时 能向他们重申我们对他们的关切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It would be gratifying to be able to reassure the nobles{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.29,0:11:42.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将会是件令人高兴的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when they arrive tomorrow that we have their interests at heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.73,0:11:46.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快点! - 动作快! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move it! -  Move it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.70,0:11:49.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续 懒猪{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go on, slowpoke.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.20,0:11:50.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去哪里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Over there. There.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.44,0:11:54.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 快啊! - 别慢下来 继续走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Move it! - Don't go slow. Keep going.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.95,0:12:04.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,动作快! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move it along!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.79,0:13:20.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小姐？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lady?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.04,0:14:44.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那是真的吗？你跟我父亲说…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is it true what you told my father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:47.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你杀它们的时候毫无感觉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that you feel nothing when you kill them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.22,0:14:51.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们只是野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They're just animals,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.59,0:14:54.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,完全不会思考或感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}incapable of thought or feeling,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.52,0:14:58.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要对它们有感觉？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}so why should I feel anything for them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.56,0:15:07.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索妮亚 如果我要离开这里 你愿意跟我走吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonja, if I were to leave from here, would you come with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.44,0:15:13.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离开？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Leave?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.31,0:15:16.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别提那个字眼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not say that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.48,0:15:18.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,连想都别想 他们会猎杀你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do not even think it. They would hunt you down{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.95,0:15:22.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 把你当野兽 - 若我能拿掉这个就不一定了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- and they would mark you like all the others. - Not if I could remove this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.55,0:15:24.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:26.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我做的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I made it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.59,0:15:29.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是我的自由{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This will be my freedom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.46,0:15:34.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩 答应我你不会用它{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian, promise me you won't use it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.23,0:15:36.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 拜托 - 那么这就是你的答案了？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Please. - Is that your answer, then?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.26,0:15:39.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不会跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You will not come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.40,0:15:41.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你要我为你留下？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So you want me to stay here for you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.97,0:15:45.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 像这样？像动物一样？- 卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Like this, like an animal? - Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.44,0:15:55.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼和狼人 我们都是柯文纳斯的子孙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Vampire and Lycan, we are both children of Corvinus,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.52,0:15:57.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,然而我的族人却是奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}yet my family are slaves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.45,0:16:00.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会用这把钥匙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will use this key,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:03.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也会离开此地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and I will leave this place,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.63,0:16:08.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过没有你我不会走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I can never be without you now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.05,0:17:03.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有我女儿的消息吗？- 她很叛逆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Any news of my daughter? - She's most defiant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.09,0:17:07.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她拒绝见我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She refuses to see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.15,0:17:10.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 也不肯应门 - 年轻人怎么都这么盲目？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Will not answer her door. - Why are the young so blind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.59,0:17:13.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她会丧失理事会席位 为了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She risks her seat on the council, and for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.06,0:17:16.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我无法想像{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot imagine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.33,0:17:19.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得准备了 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must prepare, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.60,0:17:22.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,人类贵族已经上路了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Human nobles are on their way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.69,0:18:16.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它很锋利 必能劈死恶狼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's sharp. No wolf will stand before it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.53,0:18:20.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,备马{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ready the horses.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.23,0:18:24.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让别人去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let someone else go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.17,0:18:28.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么？- 昨晚 我和你分手之后…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Last night, after I left you...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.24,0:18:30.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让别人去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Just let someone else go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.64,0:18:33.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可能没注意到 铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}In case it had escaped your notice, blacksmith,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:36.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我很有能力照顾自己{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am quite capable of looking after myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.75,0:18:42.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And besides,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.85,0:18:45.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以从城墙上看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you can watch over me from the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.26,0:18:55.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回去后面{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Get your back to the rear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.70,0:18:59.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索妮亚小姐 您父亲下令要您留下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lady Sonja, your father has ordered you to stay behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.43,0:19:03.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想亲自护送我们的客人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I intend to see our guests safely through the gate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.30,0:19:06.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 守门人 - 这不是请求{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gate master. - This is not a request.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.44,0:19:08.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,您父亲是我们的领袖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your father is ruler of the coven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.44,0:19:10.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他也一直提醒我这一点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So he keeps reminding me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.59,0:19:25.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,回去! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Get back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.56,0:19:30.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,注意点 铁匠{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Careful, blacksmith,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.56,0:19:32.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别让你的眼神泄露秘密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}lest your eyes betray your secret.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.44,0:19:40.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,稳住 稳住{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Steady. Steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.41,0:19:43.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,关上窗 孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Shut it, my child. Shut it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.88,0:19:49.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,准备迎击! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Form up!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.54,0:20:12.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.37,0:20:14.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快让你的手下出去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get your men out there now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.91,0:20:17.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,冷静点 你太激动了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down, boy. Your leash is too tight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.68,0:20:19.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 稳住! - 它们太多了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Step away. - There's too many of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.85,0:20:21.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这会是一场屠杀{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They'll be massacred.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.25,0:20:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,阻止他! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stop him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.03,0:20:34.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,骑出去…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Ride out. Ride out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.28,0:20:53.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,小心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Easy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.78,0:20:55.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,迪米特里! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Dimitri.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.61,0:22:02.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.00,0:22:18.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索妮亚! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonja!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.48,0:22:39.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩 不! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.56,0:23:24.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! 住手! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.98,0:23:39.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是为了救我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He did it to save me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.88,0:23:43.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不是主人了吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Am I not master of this house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.99,0:23:47.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道颈圈是绝对不能取下的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know you are forbidden to remove your shackle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.72,0:23:48.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.89,0:23:51.85,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我赐你新生 你却抗命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yet you break my law after I gave you your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.96,0:23:56.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你舒适的生活结束了 奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your days of plush living are over, slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.56,0:23:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲 放了他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, leave him be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:59.67,0:24:02.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我说过… - 给我住嘴{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I told you... - Hold your tongue!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.54,0:24:04.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是你最后一次违抗我的命令{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have defied me for the last time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.21,0:24:07.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把她带走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Get her out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:18.15,0:24:19.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,烧了尸体{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn the bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.02,0:24:22.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,全都烧掉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Burn them all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.82,0:24:57.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为拿掉颈圈…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For removing the collar,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.06,0:25:00.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,三十鞭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}30 lashes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.87,0:25:17.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的背叛令我难过 狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have stung me, Lycan, with your betrayal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.81,0:25:21.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你原本就像是我的儿子一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were like a son to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.68,0:25:24.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给了你生命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave you your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.52,0:25:26.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你却给我枷锁{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You gave me chains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.82,0:25:30.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我早该想到 经过这些年 你早该学会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have thought, after all these years, you would have known{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.76,0:25:34.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你毕竟得跟你的同类在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you cannot have one without the other.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.10,0:25:38.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,动手吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:46.81,0:25:49.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我说过你失宠时我必会在场{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I told you I'd be there when you fell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:58.65,0:26:59.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么？- 停手吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What? - Stop this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:00.08,0:27:02.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 他是我们的护卫 - 他们只是野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He is one of our protectors. - They are but beasts themselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.95,0:27:05.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这可能会激怒其他狼人 - 随便他们 你怕他们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- This could stir up the others. - Let them stir. Do you fear them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.05,0:27:07.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,相信我 不惩罚结果只会更糟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Believe me, it will be worse if we do not punish them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:08.12,0:27:10.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你以为在城外能信任他们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you see now, Coloman? You would trust them{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.36,0:27:13.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们连在城内都信不过了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}outside the walls? We cannot even trust them inside.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.69,0:27:16.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,照我计算 那是第二十一鞭{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}By my count, that's 21.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.13,0:27:19.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Continue.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.27,0:27:23.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,好可怕的声音{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Oh, what a terrible sound.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.94,0:27:27.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,臭死了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bloody stink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.82,0:27:47.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,离他远点 不然他们也会惩罚你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Stay away from him, or they'll punish you too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.11,0:28:05.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你对卢西恩的关心真令人感动{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your concern for Lucian was most touching.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.25,0:28:08.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一个奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A slave.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.21,0:28:10.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他刚刚救了我一命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He had just saved my life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.72,0:28:14.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前不是叫我要心存感激？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Was it not you who told me to show a little gratitude?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.09,0:28:16.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你自己呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And yourself?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.39,0:28:18.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不感谢救你女儿一命的人？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you no gratitude for the one who saved your daughter's life?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.83,0:28:20.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我感激涕零{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I am awash with it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.69,0:28:23.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他能活命显示我的宽容大量{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That he lives shows the breadth of my magnanimity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.26,0:28:24.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,换做别的情况{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were it any other circumstances,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.93,0:28:29.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我早把他扔去 给他自己的族人分食{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I would have had him fed in pieces to his own kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.27,0:28:32.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过他的惩罚现在已经结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But his punishment is now over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.01,0:28:36.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你会释放他吧？ - 释放？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- He will be freed. - Freed?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.34,0:28:38.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的判断有点迟钝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your judgment is clouded, Sonja.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.85,0:28:40.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是用情感来保持秩序的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do not keep order with sentiment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.75,0:28:44.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩拿掉他不准拿掉的颈圈{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian was forbidden to remove his collar, and yet he did so,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.75,0:28:47.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不论理由有多好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for however fine a reason.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.15,0:28:50.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他都得留在牢里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will remain in prison,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.39,0:28:54.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,用以告诫他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}a cautionary tale.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.90,0:29:00.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亚诺士和其他贵族即将抵达{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janosh and the other nobles will soon arrive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.73,0:29:03.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的出席是必要的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your presence is expected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.51,0:29:12.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我看到你的身手{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I saw what you did out there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.95,0:29:15.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很勇猛{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Very brave{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.72,0:29:17.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对一个人类而言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}for a human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:20.75,0:29:22.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你之前遭遇过它们吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you come across them before?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.12,0:29:25.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,完全没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Only in stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.43,0:29:28.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不怕它们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Were you not afraid of them?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.80,0:29:30.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.50,0:29:33.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我想活命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but I wanted to live.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:33.87,0:29:35.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你怕我吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you afraid of me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.27,0:29:43.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怕 - 不用怕{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Well, do not be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:44.78,0:29:46.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不咬人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will not bite...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.38,0:29:49.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不大咬{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.79,0:29:54.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你跟它们一样？- 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You are like them? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.22,0:29:58.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是狼人 但跟它们不一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Lycan, yes, but not like them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.23,0:30:03.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你今晚对抗的是野兽 是威廉的子孙{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Those you fought with tonight were animals, the spawn of William.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:03.20,0:30:06.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,血统纯正 完全没有人类的基因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Purebloods, if you will. No trace of human left.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:07.13,0:30:10.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,野蛮、无知的野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Savage, mindless beasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.81,0:30:14.33,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 和传说一样 - 不过我看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- As it has been told. - But I saw you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.48,0:30:20.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们听你的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They obeyed you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.85,0:30:23.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.82,0:30:27.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对 没错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, they did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.83,0:30:41.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嘿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.50,0:30:46.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你不该来此 - 我必须来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Oh, you should not be here. - I had to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.84,0:30:47.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亲爱的 对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My love, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.21,0:30:50.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你的背 - 我没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your back. No, no, - I'm all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.41,0:30:52.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我的错 要是我没出去…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is my fault. If I had not gone out...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.81,0:30:54.84,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你就不是你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you would not be who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:56.85,0:30:57.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这不是你的错{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is not your fault.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.82,0:31:02.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不能留在这里 我得离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I cannot remain here. I have to leave this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.12,0:31:04.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲现在会更严加监控你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father will be watching you now more than ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.09,0:31:07.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡行者呢？里面没你的亲信？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What about your Death Dealers, are there none that you can trust?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.53,0:31:11.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们对我父亲比对我忠心{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Unfortunately, their loyalty to my father is greater than their loyalty to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.16,0:31:12.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坦尼斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tannis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:13.40,0:31:15.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不能相信他 - 不 他知道我们的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Tannis cannot be trusted. - No, Tannis, he knows about us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.37,0:31:20.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 怎么会？- 我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- How? - I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.34,0:31:23.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若他还没告诉你父亲 那就有鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But if he still has not told your father, then that must mean he wants something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.54,0:31:26.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去查他在打什么算盘{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonja, find out what it is.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.54,0:31:53.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带他们进来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Bring them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.15,0:32:35.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,亚诺士{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Janosh.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.05,0:32:43.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不是拥有最大的银矿吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not own the largest silver mine in these lands?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.39,0:32:45.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,已经都荒废了 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has been overrun, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.03,0:32:48.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,工人都受到感染{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Our workers infected,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:48.39,0:32:49.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,变成野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}turned to beasts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.56,0:32:50.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真不幸{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Most unfortunate,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:51.33,0:32:53.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,牺牲真大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and costly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.97,0:32:55.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你矿场一半的权益…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think half the rights to your mine{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.10,0:32:58.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,应该能偿付我们援助的费用吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}should cover the expense of our assistance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.57,0:33:00.13,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们的援助？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What assistance?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.27,0:33:02.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们在来的路上都看到火焰{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have all seen the fires on the way here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.04,0:33:06.00,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也知道卡瓦哈男爵和他家人的死讯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have learned of the deaths of Baron Covasha and his family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.21,0:33:07.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,狼族也攻到你们的门口了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The wolves are at your door as well.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.05,0:33:10.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们连自保都有问题{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So why should I pay tribute{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.98,0:33:13.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我为什么要进贡给你们？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}when you cannot so much as protect your own house?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.05,0:33:17.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你已经把我榨乾了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have all but bled me dry already.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.32,0:33:19.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们都听说了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have all heard the stories.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.23,0:33:23.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看他的眼睛! 这是真的! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look into his eyes. They are true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.36,0:33:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这里受到诅咒{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This place is cursed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.37,0:33:27.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不是人了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They are no more human{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.07,0:33:30.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是魔鬼 把我们土地…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}than the devils that invade our lands.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:30.70,0:33:35.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果我们是魔鬼 放心 远比你们不知道的那些要好{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If devils you call us, rest assured, better the devil you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.61,0:33:39.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放开我 - 当然{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Unhand me. - Certainly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.05,0:33:50.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还有谁有话要说？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would anyone else like to be heard?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.16,0:33:55.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把食物送给这些肮脏的狗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Toss it here. Bring food to these filthy mongrels.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.19,0:33:58.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 来了 - 跟狗一样舔吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Here you go. - Eat it up like dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.08,0:34:12.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟狗一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Like dogs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.76,0:34:31.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:34.53,0:34:38.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,难道你们想当他们的玩具？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this what you want, to be their entertainment, their playthings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.74,0:34:40.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当他们的宠物？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Their pets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.67,0:34:43.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,蜷曲在鞭子之下{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Cowering beneath the whip{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.51,0:34:45.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,却在彼此之间争斗{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and then fighting amongst ourselves.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.38,0:34:49.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这就是你们想要的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Is this what you want?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.25,0:34:56.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一辈子都在遵守规则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have lived by their rules my entire life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:57.19,0:34:58.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我保卫他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I've protected them,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.69,0:35:00.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,嫉妒他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}envied them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.53,0:35:02.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结果呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And for what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.36,0:35:05.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,结果却被当成野兽对待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be treated like an animal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.33,0:35:07.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们不是野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We are not animals!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.40,0:35:12.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We do have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.61,0:35:15.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以选择比这更好的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can choose to be more than this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.24,0:35:17.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们可以是奴隶{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We can be slaves{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.78,0:35:21.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们也可以是狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or we can be Lycans!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.85,0:35:30.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天快亮了 我的孩子{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Morning is upon us, my child.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.56,0:35:34.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们该将不幸的夜置之脑后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's time we left this wretched night behind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.16,0:35:39.05,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我很乐意 - 眼前有一些困难的决策{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Gladly. - There are some difficult decisions ahead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:39.20,0:35:42.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我希望你的帮助 - 当然 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I would like your help with one of them. - Of course, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.70,0:35:44.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,失去了卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With Lucian gone,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.17,0:35:47.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得提拔另一个狼人取代他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}we must promote another Lycan in his place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.51,0:35:50.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,失去？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Gone?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.71,0:35:53.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,科洛曼认为他会煽动其他人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Coloman thinks he will stir the others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:53.38,0:35:55.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们必须除掉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We must remove him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.68,0:36:00.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这很困难{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That will be difficult.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.52,0:36:04.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他跟我们这么久了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He has been with us so long.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.47,0:36:14.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许用幽格吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps Gyorg.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.20,0:36:16.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或特拉斯{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Or Trasos.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.67,0:36:20.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们都很…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They would be{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.51,0:36:22.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,值得信赖{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}trustworthy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:22.71,0:36:25.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,很好的建议{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Excellent suggestions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.75,0:36:27.63,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会仔细考虑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will consider them strongly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:56.64,0:37:02.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你 我的孩子 是我心中最珍贵的宝贝{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, my child, are the most precious thing in my heart.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:24.77,0:37:26.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你跟我父亲说了什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What have you told my father?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.51,0:37:29.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你说了什么？- 什么都没说{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What have you told him? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.64,0:37:30.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 为什么？- 什么为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Why? - Why what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.24,0:37:33.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么没说？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why have you told him nothing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.38,0:37:37.68,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的父亲 会很高兴有人告诉他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Would your father welcome the man who brought him news{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.92,0:37:40.75,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他心爱女儿的交往对象…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that his beloved daughter was consorting{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.42,0:37:42.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是狼人吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with a Lycan?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.59,0:37:49.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他是知名的冷酷无情{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He isn't well known for his gratitude.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.91,0:38:04.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我还不想利用这个消息 替自己谋福利{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And I am not yet in a position to use this for my benefit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:09.15,0:38:10.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,什么样的福利？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What sort of benefit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.32,0:38:15.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,理事会的议员有十二席{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are 12 council seats.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.62,0:38:17.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们又不常死人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And we don't die often.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.96,0:38:20.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,真可惜 是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sadly, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.46,0:38:22.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我放弃我在理事会的席位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So, what if I gave up my seat at council?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.56,0:38:24.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,直接留给你呢？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Simply left it to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:24.86,0:38:25.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你为什么要那么做？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why would you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.60,0:38:28.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能保守秘密吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Can you keep a secret?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.57,0:38:34.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我需要一些回报{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will need something in return.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.46,0:38:59.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,只有两分钟{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Two minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.77,0:39:01.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再久就会有危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any longer is too risky.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:06.07,0:39:09.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 没有其他办法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry. There was no other way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:14.78,0:39:16.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坦尼斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So Tannis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.72,0:39:20.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对 他想要理事会的席位{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right. He will help us in exchange for a seat on the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:20.22,0:39:22.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 而你父亲毫不知情？- 我很确定{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Your father knows nothing? - I'm sure of it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.56,0:39:24.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 索妮亚 干的漂亮 - 必须如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sonja, this can work. - Lucian, it has to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.89,0:39:26.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想有些人会跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think some of the others will come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.39,0:39:27.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 萨巴斯、瑞思托、雷兹 - 亲爱的…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Sabas and Xristo, the human Raze. - My love...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.03,0:39:30.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我肯定可以… - 卢西恩 没时间了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I'm certain I can... - Lucian, there is no time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.53,0:39:33.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我父亲明天等人类离开 就会处决你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My father will have you killed tomorrow, after the humans are turned.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.80,0:39:36.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你必须在天亮时离开{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You must leave at sunrise.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.70,0:39:39.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你呢？- 重要的是你保住性命{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And you? - The important thing is you stay alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.97,0:39:42.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多和死亡行者入睡时 是你的好机会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The best chance you have is when Viktor and the Death Dealers sleep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.04,0:39:44.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你走之后 我在父亲身边很安全{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will be safely at my father's side when you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.34,0:39:46.50,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} Hurry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.88,0:39:49.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,计划若成功 三天后日落时见{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If this plan works, I'll meet you in three days' time, after the sun sets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.72,0:39:52.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,河边有个空地 我在那里等你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There's a clearing by the river. I'll meet you there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.96,0:40:03.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不成功呢？- 我会在空地等你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- And if it doesn't? - I will meet you at the clearing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.81,0:40:23.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,靠墙站好! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Face the wall.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.58,0:40:26.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 出来 - 你们这些野兽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Get out. - You animals.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.09,0:40:30.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你! 马上回去! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You. Get back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.46,0:40:33.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,勇敢点 人类{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be brave, human.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.63,0:40:41.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道你有什么问题吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You know what your problem is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.94,0:40:47.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白大自然的法则{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You don't understand the natural order of things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.71,0:40:50.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,凡事都会变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.64,0:40:52.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那你可要准备好了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Be ready when they do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:59.75,0:41:01.71,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,把这当成临别的礼物吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Consider it a parting gift.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.60,0:41:44.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等等! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:47.90,0:41:51.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你不明白这是我给你的礼物？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you not realize this is a gift I am giving you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.50,0:41:53.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是诅咒! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It's a curse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:04.12,0:42:07.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 它们？对我们做了什么 - 你很快就会知道的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- What have they done to us? - You'll find out soon enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.02,0:42:10.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们把我们变成…和你一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They turned us into... Like you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.92,0:42:12.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.63,0:42:13.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为什么？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.79,0:42:16.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他要利用你来保护他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He wants to use you for his own protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.56,0:42:17.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会先死{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will die first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.66,0:42:20.76,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那可能不会发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Well, that may not happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:20.97,0:42:22.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,时候到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The time has come.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.54,0:42:24.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,天亮时 我会离开此地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}At sunrise, I leave this place.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.97,0:42:27.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,愿意冒险的人可以跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Anyone willing to take the risk may follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.08,0:42:35.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,墙外有新的生活等着我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is a new life waiting beyond these walls, my friend,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.95,0:42:39.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以成为我们的一部分{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and you can be a part of it, one of us,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.62,0:42:41.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是留下来侍奉他们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or stay and serve them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:46.09,0:42:48.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,警卫来了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} The guards are coming.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.53,0:42:55.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今天有新狗 看看他们的长相{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}New dogs today. Let's see how they look.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:55.70,0:42:56.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你来太晚了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You've come too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.70,0:42:59.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他已经走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's already gone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.30,0:43:34.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们要跟我走吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:08.21,0:44:12.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,萨巴斯、瑞思托 释放其他人 其他的跟我走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sabas, Xristo, free the others. The rest of you with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.82,0:44:19.91,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freedom is yours.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.05,0:44:21.88,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快走! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.26,0:44:27.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往这边! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.23,0:44:31.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,下面! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:55.82,0:44:58.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快走! 跑! 跑! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All right, move. Run, run, run.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.86,0:45:02.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续跑! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.00,0:45:09.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续跑! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep moving. Keep moving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.17,0:45:13.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,继续跑! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep going. Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.02,0:45:32.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,发射! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.32,0:46:02.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,雷兹! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Raze.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.19,0:46:04.78,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你无能为力了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There is nothing you can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.19,0:46:09.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我会回来的! 我保证! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will come back. I promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.90,0:46:11.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.90,0:46:16.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:21.81,0:46:24.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大人 卢西恩逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord, Lucian is escaping.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:50.27,0:46:52.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往森林去! 快去! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Forest, go. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:10.06,0:47:11.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大人! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.21,0:47:35.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Move here. Move it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.18,0:47:37.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你! 进去! - 快点! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You, get in there. - Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.25,0:47:40.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 就这些？没漏掉任何一个？- 是的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are all these accounted for? Each and every one. - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:40.49,0:47:42.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,坦尼斯？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Tannis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:42.39,0:47:43.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快点! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Come on. Move.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:45.22,0:47:47.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是的 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, my lord?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:47.03,0:47:48.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我给你的钥匙在那里？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Where is the key I gave you for this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:49.60,0:47:52.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我亲自把它锁在军械库的 - 那么它是怎么开的？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I locked it in the armory myself. - How, then, is it open?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.20,0:47:55.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.37,0:47:57.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想我知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I think I have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:58.04,0:48:00.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 杀了他! - 不! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Kill him. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:00.41,0:48:02.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.94,0:48:04.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去看军械库{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Check the armory.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.91,0:48:06.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定有一个解释的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There has to be an explanation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:07.11,0:48:09.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带我去看{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Show me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.66,0:48:22.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我从没出过城 - 趁你可以享受时享受吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I've never been outside the walls. - Well, enjoy it while you can, Xristo.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.19,0:48:25.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们很快就得打回去了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Because soon enough we're gonna have to fight our way back in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:25.13,0:48:28.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们没全逃出来 我不会丢下弟兄…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We did not all make it out, and I will not leave our brothers to rot back there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:28.53,0:48:31.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多受辱 会拿他们出气{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We humiliated Viktor. It is they who will pay the cost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:31.37,0:48:33.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过我们很幸运能活着逃出来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But we were lucky to make it out alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:33.61,0:48:36.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们人数不多 又没武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And there's but a handful of us. We have no weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.48,0:48:37.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,目前是如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}True, for now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:38.08,0:48:40.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你能带我们去贵族的领地吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The noble who brought you here, can you lead us back to his estate?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:40.98,0:48:44.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 可以 - 好 走吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Yes. - Good. Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:12.34,0:49:14.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一定在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It has to be here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:17.72,0:49:19.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我放在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I put it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:23.12,0:49:24.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:27.53,0:49:30.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他一定还有另一把{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He must have made another one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.03,0:49:34.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我从未怀疑过你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I never doubted you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:42.14,0:49:45.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,现在我不想卸除你们的颈圈之后{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, I have no wish to remove one shackle from around your necks{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:45.68,0:49:48.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,却铐上我对你们的箝制{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}only to replace it with one of my own.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.15,0:49:50.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们有选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have a choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.42,0:49:52.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,逃跑或躲藏{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You can run and hide{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:52.38,0:49:53.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,或是留下来奋战{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}or you can stay and fight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:54.35,0:49:57.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,任何与我并肩作战者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Any man who fights with me shall have his freedom{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:58.12,0:49:59.49,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,如果他真的愿意的话…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and, if he wishes it,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:01.03,0:50:02.12,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,将会享有自由和永生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}immortality.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:06.50,0:50:08.66,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,捡起你的武器{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Pick up your weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.51,0:50:15.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们团结才能壮大{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Together we're strong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.31,0:50:20.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,西边有其他的族人领地{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are other estates to the west of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.75,0:50:23.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想要让你去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I want you to go there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:23.15,0:50:25.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看有多少人要加入我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}See how many will join us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:25.62,0:50:28.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们两天后在此碰头{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I will meet you back here in two days' time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.49,0:50:30.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 放在哪里 - 那里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Put it over there. - Over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:46.56,0:52:48.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:48.29,0:52:50.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我吓到你了？对不起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did I startle you? I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:50.70,0:52:52.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:52.80,0:52:54.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You did not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:54.67,0:52:56.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我突然想到{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It occurs to me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:56.84,0:53:00.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我一直都太粗心大意了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}that I have been thoughtless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:01.57,0:53:05.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我太沉浸于卢西恩背叛的痛苦{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}So deep have I been in my own anguish at Lucian's betrayal,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.84,0:53:08.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,却完全没考虑到…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I gave no thought{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:08.71,0:53:10.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你的感受{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}to your feelings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:11.82,0:53:13.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的感受？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My feelings?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:13.29,0:53:15.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们融入我们的生活之中{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They worm their way into our lives,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.75,0:53:19.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们却忘了他们可笑的出世{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and we forget the travesty of their birth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:20.33,0:53:23.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我自己对卢西恩充满慈悲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I myself had tenderness towards Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.70,0:53:25.72,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他可以成就大事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He could have been anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:25.86,0:53:28.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许还可以当死亡行者{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A Death Dealer, perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:29.20,0:53:30.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:32.47,0:53:34.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,也许吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Perhaps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:36.58,0:53:39.24,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过他毕竟与我们不同{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But he was not as we are,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:39.41,0:53:40.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}was he?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:44.32,0:53:46.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你是否帮助他逃亡？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Did you help him escape?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:48.49,0:53:50.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,帮助他？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Help him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:50.89,0:53:52.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,当然没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.89,0:53:56.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你在骗我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Are you lying to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.53,0:54:02.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我是做过很多违抗你的事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}There are many things that I have done against your will,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.47,0:54:04.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是他是狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but he is a Lycan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:08.07,0:54:10.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,对不起 乖女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I'm sorry, my dear,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.58,0:54:13.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你让我别无选择{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you leave me no choice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.86,0:54:25.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲 求求你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father, please...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.39,0:54:30.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我原本想相信你的谎言 虽然我知道那不是真的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I wanted to believe your lies though I knew it could not be true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:30.46,0:54:32.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是我的亲生女儿 你怎么能？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not my own daughter. How could you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:32.73,0:54:34.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Father,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:35.50,0:54:37.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:39.24,0:54:40.60,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你背叛了我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have betrayed me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.67,0:54:44.27,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟野兽在一起{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}To be with an animal!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.38,0:54:49.47,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你胜过一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I loved you more than anything!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:49.88,0:54:52.98,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不准她离开房间{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She does not leave this room!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:10.84,0:55:12.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不行 我们受命要等待{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. You're under orders to wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:20.35,0:55:21.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在这{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.35,0:55:24.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,照这速度 到周末人手就够了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This rate, we'll have enough men by the end of the week.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:24.88,0:55:28.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 有索妮亚的消息吗？- 没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Has there been any sign of Sonja? - Nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.69,0:55:33.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她应该早就到了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She should have been here by now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:33.43,0:55:36.59,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩 等她并不明智{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}With respect, Lucian, I do not see the wisdom in waiting for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:36.63,0:55:37.82,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她不是我们的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's not one of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:37.96,0:55:40.89,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你忘了是她释放我们的吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Have you forgotten she is the one who set us free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:41.03,0:55:43.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是她是吸血鬼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But she is a vampire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:43.47,0:55:46.39,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,若她骗你 她会带他们来此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If she has deceived you, she could lead them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:46.87,0:55:49.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,死亡行者绝对会大举出击{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Death Dealers will undoubtedly be on the hunt,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:49.37,0:55:53.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们终究会找到我们 不过不会是她告的密{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}and they will eventually find us, but not by her doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:58.62,0:56:02.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我相信索妮亚 你们也该如此{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I trust Sonja with my life, and as long as I'm in command, so shall you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:05.27,0:56:08.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就跟你说什么都别讲吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Told you not to say anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:11.53,0:56:14.69,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩掠夺了布拉索夫的两个庄园{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian has sacked two estates in Brashov, my lord, and made off{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:14.83,0:56:18.53,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还偷走了他们的军械 而奴隶们加入了他的队伍{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}with the contents of their armories. The slaves have joined his ranks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.67,0:56:21.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,自由就像威廉的瘟疫一样蔓延{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Freedom is as much a disease as William's pestilence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:21.44,0:56:23.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你得把你的宠物弄回来 - 谢谢 科洛曼{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- You need to bring your pet back. - Thank you, Coloman.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:23.98,0:56:25.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我显然疏忽了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The obvious escaped me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:25.74,0:56:31.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我不用动一根手指头 卢西恩会自己回来的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I do not need to lift a finger. Lucian will return of his own free will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:33.08,0:56:36.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我有他要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have something he wants.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:37.69,0:56:39.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我的爱人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:50.57,0:56:54.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 露卡 怎么回事？她人呢？- 索妮亚被逮捕了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Luka. What is it? Where is she? - Sonja has been arrested.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:55.41,0:56:58.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他知道你们的事了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He knows about the two of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:59.44,0:57:00.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他会杀了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He will kill her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:01.55,0:57:03.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我想你该知道{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I thought you should know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.47,0:57:24.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,还没有动静 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Nothing yet, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:28.84,0:57:31.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 这是陷阱 你很清楚 - 我不会让她独自死去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- It is a trap. You know that. - I will not let her die alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:32.01,0:57:34.67,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,它们追随你来 你走了它们也会走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They followed you here, Lucian. If you go, we will lose them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:34.81,0:57:37.48,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我告诉你 它们以为它们是追随我而来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Let me tell you a secret, my friend. They thought they followed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:37.62,0:57:41.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但它们真正追随的是自由 那才是吸引它们来的原因{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}What they truly followed was the idea of being free. That's what brought them here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:41.19,0:57:45.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你可以带领它们等我回来 我若没回来 则由你领导它们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now, you can hold them together until I get back, and lead them if I do not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:43.11,0:59:45.70,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你没事吧？- 没事{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Are you all right? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:45.74,0:59:47.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是卢西恩 你已经自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But Lucian, you were free.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:47.88,0:59:49.74,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有你就不算是{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not without you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.11,0:59:52.28,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们得马上走{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have to go now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:27.82,1:00:29.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:29.92,1:00:32.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,您女儿逃走了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}your daughter has escaped.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.92,1:00:35.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她当然会逃{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Of course she has.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:50.68,1:00:51.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,往这边! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.79,1:01:11.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 那一个 - 是 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- That one. - Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:47.70,1:01:48.93,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就是现在! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.24,1:02:35.77,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你竟敢对抗我？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How dare you raise your hand to me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:36.28,1:02:39.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我不想这样 - 我是你父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I do not want this. - I am your father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.06,1:02:55.19,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你以为你能打败我吗？- 我不想打败你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you think you can defeat me? - I don't want to defeat you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.41,1:03:11.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀了我并不能救你的宝贝狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Killing me won't save your precious Lycan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:11.22,1:03:14.41,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了你的孙子 撤回你的人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Please call off your men, for the sake of your grandchild.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.96,1:03:22.79,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,这是奇迹 父亲{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A miracle, Father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.93,1:03:25.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,两条血脉的融和{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}A union of the bloodlines.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.13,1:03:32.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我诅咒你母亲生下你而死的那天{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I curse the day your mother gave her life to bring you into this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:32.84,1:03:35.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你体内的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}That thing inside you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.07,1:03:37.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是个怪物{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}is a monstrosity.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.11,1:03:42.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索妮亚! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonja!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:43.25,1:03:44.37,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.52,1:03:46.51,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带走他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Remove him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.92,1:03:48.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你明白你干了什么好事吗？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Do you understand what you have done?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:48.85,1:03:50.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚不是要逮你 而是要逮他{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This night was not about you. It was about him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:51.36,1:03:53.31,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我原可将卢西恩交给理事会{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I could have given Lucian to the council.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:53.46,1:03:56.95,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他们不需要知道你鲁莽的行为 不过经过这一切{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}They need never have known of your indiscretion, but after this,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:57.06,1:03:58.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,别想了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}never.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.83,1:04:00.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:00.50,1:04:01.86,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:12.41,1:04:16.01,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,要是我没走 这一切都不会发生{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}If I had not left, none of this would have happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.02,1:04:19.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,那么你就不是你了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Then you would not be who you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:21.19,1:04:22.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说的对{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You were right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:23.02,1:04:25.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,没有人该过这种生活{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No one should live a life like this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:26.52,1:04:29.36,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,其他人因为你而自由了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Others are free because of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.39,1:04:33.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,因为你的作为 一切已彻底改变{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Things are forever changed because of what you have done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:33.23,1:04:35.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不过我令你失望了 - 不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- But I have failed you. - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:35.87,1:04:38.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩 我亲爱的{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian, my love,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:39.24,1:04:41.03,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你没有令我失望{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}you have not failed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:43.31,1:04:45.54,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是我做的决定让我来到这里{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The choices I made have led me here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.28,1:04:47.57,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不是你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Not you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.08,1:04:53.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你说过你愿为我承受危险{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You said yourself there are risks that you were willing to take for me,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.59,1:04:56.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了你我也一样{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}as was I for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.49,1:04:58.18,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,为了我们{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}For us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:59.59,1:05:01.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,开门! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Open the door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.26,1:05:05.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 - 起来! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. - Get up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.46,1:05:07.45,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 不 不 - 快啊{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- No. No. - Come on. Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.60,1:05:09.96,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 我会杀了你! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No. I'll kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.13,1:05:12.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你们全部! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}All of you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:36.23,1:05:40.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,被告的罪名是谋逆{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The accused has committed high treason against the coven.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:41.10,1:05:44.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她与野兽往来 她帮助他们逃亡{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She has consorted with animals. She has abetted in their escape.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.97,1:05:49.10,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我拯救过我族许多次{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I have saved this coven many times over.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:49.24,1:05:50.64,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你也杀害过自己的同胞{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You have killed your own kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:51.38,1:05:53.61,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你还混杂血脉{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}And you've commingled bloodlines,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:53.98,1:05:57.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,在你体内培育出那玩意儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}resulting in the thing germinating within you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:58.02,1:06:01.94,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你过去的一切也无法补偿你造下的罪孽{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your past glory does not excuse your present guilt,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.09,1:06:05.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,鉴于你是理事会成员{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}nor does your station as a council member.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:05.99,1:06:09.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,显然你的惩罚应该是死刑{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}The punishment for these crimes is death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.23,1:06:11.46,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,但是我们投票表决{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}How vote you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:19.04,1:06:20.56,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赞成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.67,1:06:22.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 赞成 - 赞成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aye. - Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:22.67,1:06:25.23,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 赞成 - 赞成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Aye. - Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:28.28,1:06:29.97,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,她是你女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}She's your daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.56,1:06:42.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,赞成{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Aye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:42.46,1:06:44.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,带她去死刑室{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Take her to the chamber.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:44.70,1:06:46.65,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 你们不能这么做{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, you... You cannot do this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:47.03,1:06:48.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我们来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&} My lady, come with us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:48.57,1:06:51.42,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 请保持安静 - 求你了 维克多! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Come quietly, - please. Viktor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:51.67,1:06:54.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多! 不! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor. No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.14,1:06:56.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多! 不! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Viktor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:46.62,1:07:48.35,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.51,1:08:45.14,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.68,1:09:14.17,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不 索妮亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No, Sonja.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:14.28,1:09:15.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不要 看着我{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Don't. Just look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.71,1:09:17.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,眼睛看着我 索妮亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Keep your eyes on me, Sonja.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:17.31,1:09:18.30,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,看着我! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Look at me!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.56,1:09:29.32,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:31.56,1:09:33.55,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我也爱你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}As I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.87,1:09:42.40,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,等一切结束 你就不在了 是吧？{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Your face will not be here when this is over, will it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.25,1:09:51.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,再见了 我的爱{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Goodbye, my love.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:53.48,1:09:54.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:00.49,1:10:10.20,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:12.94,1:10:16.43,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,索妮亚! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Sonja!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.73,1:11:52.73,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 去拿我的刀 - 是 大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Fetch my knives. - Yes, my lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.40,1:13:27.52,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,大人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}My lord.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:23.05,1:15:25.11,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去…{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go. Go. Quickly. Go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.55,1:16:01.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,去放其他人 快去{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Now go free the others. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.96,1:16:11.02,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,跟我来{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Follow me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:15.77,1:16:18.26,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 你们想复仇吗？- 想! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- Do you want your revenge? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.60,1:16:20.83,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,就在外面 去吧{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is out there. Now go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.13,1:16:48.22,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,我们有比卷轴更重要的东西{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}We have greater concerns than your precious scrolls.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:48.60,1:16:50.09,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,快去找长老! 快! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Go to the elders, now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:20.13,1:17:23.62,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,杀光这些野狗! {\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Kill the dogs!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.17,1:17:25.90,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,维克多{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Viktor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:49.75,1:18:51.38,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你玷污了我女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You defiled my daughter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:51.72,1:18:53.25,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,- 我爱她 - 你害死了她{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}- I loved her! - You killed her!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.00,1:20:08.92,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你出生那天我就该杀了你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}I should have crushed you under my heel the day you were born.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:09.07,1:20:11.16,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,是啊 你是应该{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Yes, you should have...{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:17.07,1:20:18.80,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,可是你没有{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}but you didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.43,1:21:10.81,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:11.39,1:21:13.06,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:24.47,1:21:26.34,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,卢西恩{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lucian.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.14,1:21:28.87,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,都结束了{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}It is finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:31.48,1:21:33.07,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:34.95,1:21:36.44,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一切才刚开始{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}This is just the beginning.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.18,1:22:39.04,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,让我告诉你 你所深爱的黑暗之父{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But let me tell you a little something about your beloved dark father.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:40.05,1:22:44.21,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他才是害死你家人的凶手 不是狼人{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}He's the one who killed your family. Not the Lycans.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:45.09,1:22:47.08,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,不过当他看到你{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}But when he got to you,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:47.22,1:22:51.15,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他却不忍心有吸乾你血的想法{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}he just couldn't bear the thought of draining you dry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.29,1:22:56.58,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,你...让他回忆起了心爱的索妮亚{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}You, who reminded him so much of his precious Sonja,{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:57.43,1:23:01.29,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,他亲自处决的女儿{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}the daughter he condemned to death.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:03.43,1:23:04.99,chs,,0000,0000,0000,,一派胡言{\r}\N{\fnCronos Pro Subhead\fs14\1c&H3CF1F3&}Lies.{\r}
